<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.1.1>	Refulget omnis luce mundus aurea
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.1.2>	Perfusus, aether inrorat dulcedinem,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.1.3>	Astra iocundis celum luminariis
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.1.4>	Cingit per omne decus radiantia,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.1.5>	Distillat aer balsamorum guttulas.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.2.1>	Occasus, ortus, aquilo, septentrion,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.2.2>	Tellusque pontus, oceani limites,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.2.3>	Lati polorum iubilate cardines,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.2.4>	Fontes aquarum, flumina labentia,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.2.5>	Gaudete campi, montium cacumina.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.3.1>	Surrexit ecce dominus ab inferis,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.3.2>	Deuicta morte cum triumpho rediit,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.3.3>	Uictor iniquum spoliauit tartarum,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.3.4>	Claustra gehennae fregit et cyrographum
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.3.5>	Mortis cruore diluit rosifluo.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.4.1>	Sol, scema mundi, decus caeli rutilum,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.4.2>	Delusit omne seculum meridie,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.4.3>	Texit globorum lampades nigredine,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.4.4>	Celum tabescit, tetra nocte territus
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.4.5>	Languit orbis obsitus caligine.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.5.1>	Expauit arua, tremuerunt maria,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.5.2>	Uelum rescissum templi mox per medium,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.5.3>	Fisse deinde patuerunt silices,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.5.4>	Multa piorum corpora surrexerant
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.5.5>	De monumentis, dudum qui dormierant.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.6.1>	Vt uidit anguis, immolatum uespere
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.6.2>	Corporis almi sanctum sacrificium,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.6.3>	Quod mane celum repleuit odoribus,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.6.4>	Dolore multo saucius increpuit,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.6.5>	Percussus agni mansueti uulnere.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.7.1>	Vidit in ara sacram crucis hostiam,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.7.2>	Sanguinis undam, laticem de latere
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.7.3>	Sancto fluentem, saeculi qui crimina
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.7.4>	Abluit, alta paradysi gaudia
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.7.5>	Data latroni, fractus colla sibila.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.8.1>	Felix refulsit tristia post sabbata
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.8.2>	Dies serena perlustrata lumine,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.8.3>	Quae sola cunctis antefertur diebus,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.8.4>	In qua redemptor surrexit a mortuis,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.8.5>	Mundi superbo superato principe.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.9.1>	Venit Maria Magdalene sabbati
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.9.2>	Altera simul Maria diluculo
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.9.3>	Ad monumentum, portantes aromata,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.9.4>	Ut ualde mane corpus sacratissimum
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.9.5>	Christi linirent redolenti crismate.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.10.1>	Concussa tellus ab imo resiliit,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.10.2>	Terrore pulsa riguerunt marmora,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.10.3>	Inuasit horror mulieres pauidas,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.10.4>	Ab ore namque monumenti lapidem
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.10.5>	Dum sanctus ouans angelus reuolueret.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.11.1>	Flentes at ille loquebantur mutuo:
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.11.2>	"Quis a sepulchro clauso nobis ostio
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.11.3>	Magno remouet lapide, quo zmyrnea
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.11.4>	Tinguatur unda corpus, aromaticis
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.11.5>	Litum respiret pretiosis roribus?"
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.12.1>	Angelus, ecce, domini perfulgidus
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.12.2>	Sedens in albis reuoluto lapide
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.12.3>	Talibus illas refouet alloquiis:
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.12.4>	"Quid mulieres uiuentem cum mortuis
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.12.5>	Queritis? Ipse surrexit ut dixerat.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.13.1>	En, ecce locus, ubi fuit positus
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.13.2>	Dominus. Ite, dicite discipulis:
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.13.3>	Surrexit autem, Galileam petiit,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.13.4>	Destruxit eum, qui mortis imperium
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.13.5>	Habebat ante, sicuti praedixerat."
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.14.1>	Ibant alacri pectore feliciter,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.14.2>	Occurrit illis Iesus, mundi gloria,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.14.3>	Mitis, suauis ac desiderabilis,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.14.4>	Totus benignus, dulce desiderium,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.14.5>	Salus perennis eternorum ciuium.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.15.1>	Spes namque mundi salutaris unica,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.15.2>	Fons, uita, uirtus, sempiterna ueritas,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.15.3>	Pietas ardens, omnis consolacio,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.15.4>	Uultu sereno solis super radium
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.15.5>	Dixit "Auete" sanctis mulieribus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.16.1>	Ille sacratos ac desiderabiles
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.16.2>	Sanctosque pedes tenuerunt dulcius,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.16.3>	Dederant strictim basia melliflua,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.16.4>	Plantas beatas non cessabant lambere
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.16.5>	Aper mille uices uenerandis labiis.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.17.1>	O quam beatas, felices, lectissimas
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.17.2>	Quapropter istas mulieres dixerim!
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.17.3>	Sed nullus inest mihi sermo facilis,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.17.4>	Qui possit harum saltim summum tegminis
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.17.5>	De laude filum promulgando tangere.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.18.1>	Istos sacratos patriarche nobiles,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.18.2>	Multi prophete, reges et pontifices
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.18.3>	Pedes uidere uoluerunt anxie,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.18.4>	Sed non uiderunt, quos felices femine
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.18.5>	Dulci retentu meruerunt stringere.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.19.1>	Tunc Iesus illis, totus bonus dominus,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.19.2>	Dixit: "Nolite iam ultra pauescere,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.19.3>	Sed ite, meis dicite discipulis,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.19.4>	In Galileam montis in cacumine
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.19.5>	Eant, ibique me uidebunt pariter."
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.20.1>	Hec quippe iussa festinante poplite
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.20.2>	Peracta, sanctis dixerunt discipulis:
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.20.3>	"Surrexit, ecce, dominus ut dixerat,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.20.4>	In Galilaea montis super uerticem,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.20.5>	Illuc euntes, uos eum uidebitis."
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.21.1>	Cursim uenerunt undecim discipuli
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.21.2>	In Galileam, sed Petrus ex nomine
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.21.3>	Uenit uocatus, suum namque dominum
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.21.4>	Adorauerunt, quibus uulnus lancee
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.21.5>	Ostendit adque clauorum uestigia.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.22.1>	Magno beati sunt gauisi gaudio
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.22.2>	Omnesque prorsus felices discipuli.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.22.3>	Quidam labenti dubitabant pectore,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.22.4>	Firmabat unus Thomas: "Nisi uidero
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.22.5>	Latus apertum, non credam, per lanceam.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.23.1>	Nisi sacratis fixuras in manibus
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.23.2>	Tangam, foderunt quas clauorum iacula,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.23.3>	Non credam." Iesus cui dulcis dominus
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.23.4>	Palpanda membra concessit continuo.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.23.5>	"Dominus" inquid "meus et deus meus."
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.24.1>	Tunc dixit illis: "Pax uobis, en ego sum.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.24.2>	Omnis potestas in celo cum gloria
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.24.3>	Est data mihi, fixo corde credite,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.24.4>	In terra summa potestas, uictoria
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.24.5>	Mihi manebit per aeterna secula."
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.25.1>	Cur dicis, alta dei sapiencia,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.25.2>	Hanc esse tibi potestatem traditam,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.25.3>	Quam semper habes cum patre consimilem,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.25.4>	Datam sed carnis per naturam subditam,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.25.5>	De matre sancta quam uenisti sumere?
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.26.1>	A patre data non creditur aliter
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.26.2>	Gignendo nisi modo ineffabili,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.26.3>	Nam semper aequa, semper compar gloria
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.26.4>	Patri tibique sanctoque spiritui
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.26.5>	Manet, potestas, uirtus, laus, imperium.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.27.1>	Spirans in eis insufflauit protinus,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.27.2>	"Sanctum" profatur "accipite spiritum.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.27.3>	Peccata quorum commissa dimittitis,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.27.4>	Erunt remissa, quorumque tenebitis,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.27.5>	Erunt retenta". His preceptis addidit:
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.28.1>	"Nunc ite, cunctas per mundum celeriter
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.28.2>	Gentes docete, Iordanis sub gurgite
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.28.3>	In patris adque filii et spiritus
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.28.4>	Sancti lauate nomine, praecipite
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.28.5>	Mundo servare lauacri misterium.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.29.1>	Docete cuncta seruare ruriculas
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.29.2>	Precepta uobis que mandaui lucida,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.29.3>	Quo tendit orbis quattuor ad angulos.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.29.4>	En ego cunctis sum uobiscum diebus,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.29.5>	Quousque saecli fiat consummacio."
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.30.1>	Mors inimica se perisse doleat,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.30.2>	Mortua uita mortis regnum diripit,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.30.3>	Mors ultra iam non illi dominabitur,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.30.4>	Ouem reduxit ad ouile perditam,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.30.5>	In cruce totum renouauit seculum.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.31.1>	Sit tibi deo patri laus et gloria,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.31.2>	Sit crucifixo decus et imperium.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.31.3>	Sanctoque simul potestas spiritui,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.31.4>	Sit trinitati salus indiuidua
<paulin_aquil. carm. 12.31.5>	Per cuncta semper seculorum secula.
